  "description": "Two intersecting space planes alpha and beta containing respectively a and b, with common line c. Preserve all five line/plane labels and the source hidden rear boundary. Exact projected parallelism and coherent patch extents are unmeasured affine display regularizations, not given lengths or angles. A faint neutral patch tone and moving alpha within its own foreground patch are legibility additions; no point or answer annotation is added.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
